@startuml m06-sequence-api-request
title REST API Request Flow — NorthStar (fictional)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #545B64
actor Client
participant "Amazon API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "AWS Lambda" as L
database "Amazon DynamoDB" as DDB

Client -> APIGW: HTTPS request
APIGW -> L: Invoke
L -> DDB: Get/Put item
DDB --> L: Result
L --> APIGW: JSON response
APIGW --> Client: 200 OK
note right of APIGW: Use official AWS icons in Draw.io masters
@enduml
